        <body>
            <div xml:id="d449">

                <pb facs="0617" n="521" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg521"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">United States Vice-Consul-General to M.
                        Bagdasarian.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="hijri gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-14"><hi rendition="#italic">22d Zeekadeh, 1315</hi> (<hi
                                rendition="#italic">April 14, 1898</hi>)</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 4.]</seg></opener>
                <p>The foreign minister has telegraphed to the Emir-i-Nizam to order your release.
                    Let me know if it is done.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
